      value: "This shows you how to record and replay the path a finger takes across the screen. This is done by adding the <color=#0FF>LeanReplayFinger</color> component to the <color=#0FF>Red Sphere</color>. The UI button\u2019s <color=#0FF>OnClick</color> event is connected to the <color=#0FF>LeanReplayFinger</color> component\u2019s <color=#0FF>Replay</color> method."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 224356063559649096, guid: 8df6337a574cdad4bb6ec66cc50c6c2b, type: 3}
